{
  "_comment": [
    "The unit half of the two status screens: the tab bar both of them share,",
    "the stat column under the unit artwork, and the parts/size/terrain boxes.",
    "Fixed labels use the compact English terminology approved for the pilot,",
    "unit, and weapon tabs. Unit type values and series names remain Thai.",
    "Every span here is fixed: the block continues straight into the next one,",
    "so a label may only be replaced by something of the same byte length or",
    "shorter, padded with the zero-width status pad. English literals use the",
    "stock font directly; only Thai values and terrain badges use the Thai page."
  ],
