  "_pool_comment": [
    "Two indexed pointer tables in bank $D2, not part of the script span above.",
    "A type value is drawn into a fixed four-character field, so 48 pixels is a",
    "measured ceiling rather than an estimate; 空陸地中 is the only spelling that",
    "does not fit with ใต้ดิน spelled out, and takes ใต้ instead.  `align` asks the",
    "builder to right-align the value the way the original padding does.",
    "地中 is underground, 空 is flight rather than the sky itself, and ฟ้า was",
    "chosen over อากาศ purely because it is 18px narrower."
  ],
